a time called now is current time.
a text called label is now's hour as text.
If label is not "" then, Print "hour read as text".
A thing called stamp has
  a time called taken.
a stamp called photo.
Set photo's taken to now.
a time called taken is photo's taken.
If taken's unix is now's unix then, Print "field copied into a time".
Get current time into later.
If later's year is greater than 2000 then, Print "year read as a number".
a time called again is now.
If again's unix is now's unix then, Print "time copied into a time".
